For $k=3$ the four triples give weight $1/4$ each on

$$
O(1,2;1,2,3),\quad O(1,2;1,2,0),\quad
O(1,3;1,3,0),\quad O(2,3;2,3,0).
$$

An exhaustion-zero queried-endpoint-only normalized rule has total
